{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30118","headline":"题从伯舍人道正里南园 · 刘得仁","name":"题从伯舍人道正里南园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝里余新第，朱门面碧岑。\n曙堂增爽气，乔木动清阴。\n直去亲瑶陛，朝回在竹林。\n风流才子调，好尚古人心。\n薜荔遮窗暗，莓苔近井深。\n礼无青草隔，诗共白衣吟。\n轩静留孤鹤，庭虚到远砧。\n掩关裁凤诏，开镜理琼簪。\n种植今如此，尘埃永不侵。\n云奔投刺者，日日待爲霖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}